name wordframenet-wfn
# WFN/WordFrameNet: FrameNet frames aligned to WordNet words, parts of speech, synset offsets, and glosses.
match WordFrameNet
witness WordFrameNet
class AcademicCurated
tier block by \n\n
names frame row...
tier line by \n
part frame by space pieces 2
content frame row
thing block frame/2
attest block row
value - row
